        "raw": "This is pretty cool -- thanks for sharing! :D \n\n@Powerhound_2000 : I read \"Does the environment have threats?\" as \"Are there threats *defined* for this environment that can/should be introduced to the scene at this point?\", but I could have read it incorrectly! :blush: (So not really \"Are there environment threats that are currently active?\".) \n\nHow did you intend it, @Dr_Flem ? Maybe there's a way to word it that would reflect that intention more closely?",
